No...

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:55.190
Eastern Branch Santera Shingo Style
Nakajima Hikaru

00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:47.020
Sanae-san.

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:52.440
Nakajima Hikaru of the Santera Shingo style thinks it's a honor...

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:55.080
...to be chosen to be your fiancé.

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:58.170
Sanae's fiancé has appeared!!
His apprentices have appeared!!

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:01.600
Th... This person is my fiancé!?

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:09.860
A macho man...

00:02:10.410 --> 00:02:13.170
And he has the same name as my Hikaru-kun...

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:16.340
I wanted to see you, Sanae-san!

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:18.380
No! No no no no no no no no no no...

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:21.480
Sa-na-e-san!

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:24.240
No~!!

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:26.780
Let's start the proposal ceremony.

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:27.280
Eh?

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:30.570
Ho... Hold on, put me down!

00:02:31.030 --> 00:02:33.450
There is no need to be embarrassed.

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:39.590
Sanae's Fiancé Appears

00:02:42.770 --> 00:02:45.460
What exactly is he planning to do?

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:47.170
What is the proposal ceremony?

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:52.830
Man from our clan will display his strength to the woman he loves.

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:56.460
Big body, burning chest, and strong muscles!

00:02:56.790 --> 00:02:58.900
Then what's the proposal ceremony?

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:03.890
The display of strength and the proposal of marriage, that, is the proposal ceremony.

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:06.450
Ma... Marriage? No way!

00:03:08.860 --> 00:03:11.350
Sanae-san, look carefully.

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:14.360
A bull?

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:17.520
He's the wildest one from home.

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:23.430
He's an energetic one.

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:29.980
Then let's start the proposal ceremony.

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:36.500
Lo... Look out!

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:40.640
He stopped it!?

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:53.290
The strength that can stop a charging bull in one hit, that's something any woman would fall for.

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:54.420
Right, Sanae?

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:55.620
Hu... Huh?

00:03:56.150 --> 00:03:57.770
Grandma is so mean.

00:03:57.950 --> 00:04:01.640
She ignored my feelings and chose my fiancé on her own.

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:05.140
The only person I love is Inuzuka-kun.

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:06.650
Hey, Sanae!

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:08.120
What are you so unsatisfied about?

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:11.580
Hikaru is the strongest among all the youngsters of the branch families.

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:14.590
His strength is five horsepower!

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:20.350
Hey, he is five horsepower, five horsepower!

00:04:20.470 --> 00:04:22.010
Do you have nothing to say?

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:25.020
I wonder what Sanae-san is unhappy about.

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:26.720
I'm so sorry.

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:31.720
You came all the way here, but it looks like the proposal ceremony is a failure.

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:36.430
I won't give up no matter what, because it was love at first sight when I saw Sanae-san.

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:39.740
She's the cutest girl I've seen.

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:43.050
She's not just cute. Sanae is...

00:04:44.070 --> 00:04:47.680
...the successor of the Shingo Nyoi Tenba Hakoromo!

00:04:44.070 --> 00:04:47.680
Note: "Shingo Nyoi Tenba Hakoromo" literately translates to "Pegasus' raiment of divine protection".

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:49.120
Eh!?

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:55.770
Shingo Nyoi Tenba Hakoromo is the legendary garment that is given to the successor of the clan.

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:55.770
I've never seen it

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:58.010
Does it really exist!?

00:04:58.180 --> 00:04:58.960
Oh yeah...

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:05.690
It's the ultimate garment that by simply wearing it would strengthen your body and bring out your hidden strength!

00:05:05.890 --> 00:05:09.470
Its power is eight horsepower!

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:12.410
Eight horsepower!?

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:14.110
Amazing!

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:16.050
What eight horsepower?

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:17.360
How?

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:23.090
I'll never wear that embarrassing outfit again.

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:25.860
Even at that time...

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:27.510
<i>No violence!</i>

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:30.040
<i>Class rep!</i>

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:31.420
<i>Hey, hey...</i>

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:33.350
<i>You shouldn't hit a girl.</i>

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:35.210
<i>Who... Who cares!</i>

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:37.180
<i>A cocky bitch like that!</i>

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:39.020
<i>This is not good...</i>

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:40.900
<i>At this rate, even Inuzuka-kun...</i>

00:05:42.410 --> 00:05:43.530
<i>You guys!</i>

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:44.810
<i>To a girl...!</i>

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:46.370
<i>Inuzuka-kun.</i>

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:47.470
<i>Let's leave.</i>

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:49.330
<i>I'm alright.</i>

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:49.920
<i>OK?</i>

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:50.930
<i>Let's go.</i>

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:54.910
<i>Inuzuka-kun...</i>

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:58.430
<i>I have to get Inuzuka-kun to somewhere safe for now...</i>

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:56.170
<i>Let's go!</i>

00:05:56.610 --> 00:05:57.620
<i>There is nothing we can do...</i>

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:58.780
<i>There is nothing we can do!</i>

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:04.240
<i>There is another quiz tomorrow, we have to go home and study...</i>

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:04.260
<i>Then I can save the other boy...</i>

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:08.730
<i>Besides, you are going to become a prosecutor in the future...</i>

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:07.200
<i>Please, Inuzuka-kun...</i>

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:08.470
<i>Please...</i>

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:12.630
<i>You are going to punish bigger criminals in the future...</i>

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:12.490
<i>Hurry up and get away from here...</i>

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:15.680
<i>You don't have to bother yourself with trivial matters like this.</i>

00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:15.340
<i>I want to protect Inuzuka-kun...</i>

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:18.300
<i>In... Inuzuka-kun...</i>

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:21.600
<i>Class rep, you have to treat your injuries.</i>

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:24.450
<i>Don't worry about me.</i>

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:25.870
<i>Go.</i>

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:27.360
<i>No...</i>

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:29.890
<i>Inuzuka-kun wants to fight...</i>

00:06:30.730 --> 00:06:32.040
<i>I can't...</i>

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:35.900
<i>Wait for me, Inuzuka-kun.</i>

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:37.300
<i>I'll come back to save you right away!</i>

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:41.900
<i>Is there somewhere I can change my cloth?</i>

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:46.900
<i>I need to hurry...</i>

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:48.540
<i>If I don't go back to help him...</i>

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:58.020
<i>That was an eye full...</i>

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:02.370
<i>I have to hurry and help him...</i>

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:03.010
<i>But...</i>

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:05.840
<i>I don't want Inuzuka-kun to see me in this outfit.</i>

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:09.590
<i>What do I do...?</i>

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:10.620
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:16.790
<i>If you don't want this to happen again, don't ever cross our path again.</i>

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:20.610
<i>That felt good.</i>

00:07:21.020 --> 00:07:22.190
<i>Wanna go to the game center?</i>

00:07:22.310 --> 00:07:23.620
<i>We don't have any money.</i>

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:26.980
<i>It's all because we were interfered before we could score some.</i>

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:29.140
<i>Hold it, you three.</i>

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:30.270
<i>Huh?</i>

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:32.750
<i>How dare you pick on Inuzuka-kun!</i>

00:07:35.560 --> 00:07:36.870
<i>Sh... She's here!</i>

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:40.230
<i>The heroine freak from the rumors!</i>

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:44.480
<i>Freak, freak! Freaky woman!</i>

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:45.980
<i>Freaky woman!</i>

00:07:46.410 --> 00:07:48.710
<i>Thank you. Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.</i>

00:07:47.470 --> 00:07:50.350
<i>Oh. Don't worry about it.</i>

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:04.350
I couldn't protect him at the end.

00:08:05.020 --> 00:08:07.250
A battle wear that's useless because it's too embarrassing to wear.

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:09.870
I'm not a freak.

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:11.920
This time for sure...

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:13.550
Uma Kamen...

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:15.510
...is to be sealed away.

00:08:25.240 --> 00:08:26.230
Inuzuka-kun...

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:29.420
When I noticed it, my eyes were always with you.

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:34.600
Koushi-dono, you did great.

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:37.560
Hey, the girls are doing high jumps over there.

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:38.620
But...

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:41.240
It's a wife's duty to look after her husband.

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:42.650
Quit it!

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:44.900
Koushi-dono. Koushi-dono!

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:46.810
It's Nakajima-san's turn next.

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:47.680
Koushi-dono? Koushi-dono. Koushi-dono!

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:48.120
Ye... Yes!

00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:52.840
I wonder when I started looking at Inuzuka-kun.

00:08:53.710 --> 00:08:56.950
Is it when Momoko-chan appeared beside him?

00:08:58.590 --> 00:09:01.740
Oh, no... I jumped with my full strength because I wasn't paying attention.

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:03.190
Awesome...

00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:07.830
Awesome!

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:09.810
Amazing!

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:12.270
Stop it already!

00:09:13.260 --> 00:09:14.070
Thank goodness.

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:16.020
No one saw me.

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:19.240
Inuzuka-kun, let's have lunch together.

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:20.000
Sure.

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:21.770
Koushi senpai!

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:26.090
Now, it's meal time, it's meal time!

00:09:27.770 --> 00:09:29.520
Look at class rep's bento.

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:31.640
It's beef.

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:32.760
Talk about luxurious.

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:35.820
We received some beef from a friend.

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:38.220
One whole bull...

00:09:38.490 --> 00:09:41.040
♪ What's on the menu today? ♪

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:47.530
What's going on here!?

00:09:47.530 --> 00:09:51.990
I used a tiny little bit of our living allowance to buy a new game.

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:55.300
This will be what we have for lunch for the time being.

00:09:57.790 --> 00:10:02.200
Why do I have to sacrifice my lunch for your hobby!?

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:03.950
Uh...

00:10:04.140 --> 00:10:06.690
If you don't mind, have some of mine.

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:07.950
Are you sure?

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:08.740
Yeah.

00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:11.400
It's a little too much for myself anyways.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:12.810
Yay!

00:10:12.850 --> 00:10:14.420
We haven't had meat for a long time.

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:18.670
Thank you for your offer, but we'd rather not.

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:22.050
We haven't fallen to the point where we have to accept others' sympathy.

00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:25.200
That's not what I meant...

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:26.630
Sis~

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:29.230
Don't hold back, let's just have some.

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:31.180
It's meat, meat~

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:35.190
On second thought, plum for lunch is the best.

00:10:35.510 --> 00:10:38.150
Koushi-dono, how's the taste.

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:39.970
Yeah, it's good.

00:10:40.090 --> 00:10:41.470
Thank goodness.

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:44.110
You can have my share too.

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:47.100
I don't need this much...

00:10:47.220 --> 00:10:48.780
Eat it yourself.

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:51.240
Don't hold back.

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:53.980
Have as much of these soft-shelled turtles as possible.

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:56.740
And... Produce a lot of sperms.

00:10:57.520 --> 00:10:58.160
Have them back.

00:10:58.760 --> 00:10:59.770
No way...

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:01.340
There is more.

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:03.500
Inuzuka-kun...

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:06.440
Here, Inuzuka-kun.

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:08.210
It's a little embarrassing.

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:11.250
You can't. Give it up.

00:11:11.800 --> 00:11:16.360
Koushi-dono is going to marry Kuzuryuu Momoko-dono.

00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:18.630
You are only his body guard.

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:21.490
You are not allowed to fall in love with him.

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:23.000
I know.

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:24.430
I know!

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:27.330
If I can't fall in love with him...

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:30.890
At the very least, I want to be with him as a friend.

00:11:31.510 --> 00:11:32.590
For that sake...

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:35.950
<i>I hate martial artists!</i>

00:11:37.240 --> 00:11:38.460
Martial Artist

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:42.250
I have to keep the fact that I'm a martial artist a secret!

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:53.960
Normally, how do you assassinate people, Iroha-dono?

00:11:53.640 --> 00:11:55.940
Sorry, the weirdoes came along too.

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:55.090
Me?

00:11:55.530 --> 00:11:57.550
Um... I use snakes.

00:11:57.140 --> 00:11:57.670
Not weird

00:11:57.140 --> 00:11:57.670
Weird

00:11:57.570 --> 00:11:58.420
Snakes, huh?

00:11:57.890 --> 00:11:58.410
Not weird

00:11:57.890 --> 00:11:58.410
Weird

00:11:58.420 --> 00:11:58.630
Yeah.

00:11:58.630 --> 00:11:59.800
That's amazing!

00:11:58.640 --> 00:11:59.170
Not weird

00:11:58.640 --> 00:11:59.170
Weird

00:11:59.400 --> 00:11:59.820
Not weird

00:11:59.400 --> 00:11:59.820
Weird

00:11:59.800 --> 00:12:00.380
You said it.

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:03.440
Inuzuka-kun has absolutely no idea about it.

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:05.890
I have to keep it a secret no matter what...

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:11.610
Weird

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:11.610
Not weird

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:11.610
The actual
border line

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:11.170
The actual border line.

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:14.420
Do you guys have any plans afterwards?

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:15.710
Not really.

00:12:15.890 --> 00:12:18.060
Wanna come to my home and play?

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:19.090
Though there isn't anything to play.

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:21.270
We have video games.

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:23.290
There are a lot of girl games.

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:24.840
Note: Called "gyaru gee" in Japanese, a girl game is also known as a bishoujo game, it refers to any game that features beautiful girls, it usually contains adult content.

00:12:23.710 --> 00:12:24.840
Girl game?

00:12:24.920 --> 00:12:28.130
I'm sorry, we don't know much about game slang.

00:12:28.270 --> 00:12:30.020
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:12:30.710 --> 00:12:32.170
Only he likes those.

00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:33.730
Momoko-chan~

00:12:33.970 --> 00:12:39.650
I'll let you play "Mahjong Heroine Academy 2: Exciting Mahjong Competition Chapter" when we are home.

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:42.640
What is it? That "Mahjong Heroine"...

00:12:43.050 --> 00:12:46.360
Hey, don't show them any of your weird collections.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:49.440
It's not weird.

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:51.600
It's a mahjong dating simulation.

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:55.240
Don't "e-he-he" me!

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:57.090
It's so peaceful.

00:12:57.470 --> 00:13:00.530
At this rate, I won't have to worry about my secret being revealed.

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:01.760
Sanae-san.

00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:07.580
I hope I won't be disturbing you.

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:08.890
Don't worry about it.

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:10.990
Wha... What are you guys doing!?

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:15.850
Well... I got tired of waiting because you aren't coming home.

00:13:16.540 --> 00:13:19.400
Give me another chance at the proposal ceremony.

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:20.720
You can't!

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:22.040
Why not!?

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:26.810
I'm living my life while hiding my identity as a martial artist.

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:32.290
Don't worry, I know what you mean. I'll never let anyone know that I'm a martial artist.

00:13:27.730 --> 00:13:32.290
Martial artist

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:35.380
You reek of a martial artist.

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:37.020
Huh? Class rep?

00:13:37.520 --> 00:13:39.050
In any case, I have to go now.

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:41.170
Wait, Sanae-san!

00:13:42.360 --> 00:13:44.160
Sorry I got left behind.

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:45.720
What a clumsy woman.

00:13:51.150 --> 00:13:53.760
I'm not going to give up, Sanae-san!

00:13:54.690 --> 00:13:56.180
Wait, Sanae-san.

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:59.640
What do you think of my strength?

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:04.600
I'm looking forward to play some girl game.

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:06.450
What are you gonna do about this!?

00:14:06.690 --> 00:14:07.770
Sanae-san.

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:11.080
Look at my strength...

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:15.630
Koushi senpai, do you want to give it a try too?

00:14:19.970 --> 00:14:21.320
Sanae-san.

00:14:21.470 --> 00:14:22.800
Give me a break...!

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:23.970
Huh?

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:25.490
Over here.

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:29.050
Look at my strength...

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:31.520
Sanae...

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:36.040
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:41.440
Cla... Class rep?

00:14:41.630 --> 00:14:42.970
It... It's nothing.

00:14:43.140 --> 00:14:43.930
I'm alright.

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:45.810
What a gloomy woman.

00:14:46.470 --> 00:14:47.910
Say whatever you want.

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:51.650
I can't let Inuzuka-kun notice any abnormality.

00:14:55.530 --> 00:14:57.450
Look carefully, Sanae-san.

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:01.090
Wha... What is he doing?

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:08.340
Don't!

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:09.160
Class rep!

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:14.910
Cla... Class rep!

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:19.250
Where is class rep?

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:20.530
She's gone!

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:22.030
Did the train drag her in?

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:23.190
No way...

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:28.080
Enough with this.

00:15:28.130 --> 00:15:29.980
I can't get married.

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:31.830
Sanae-san...

00:15:32.060 --> 00:15:37.330
Please don't try to lift cars again in front of Inuzuka-kun.

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:39.120
If Inuzuka-kun finds out...

00:15:39.530 --> 00:15:40.590
Inuzuka-kun...

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:42.660
Sanae-san.

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:45.510
Do you love Inuzuka Koushi more than me?

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:47.280
Well, you see...

00:15:48.350 --> 00:15:49.180
I see.

00:15:50.020 --> 00:15:53.520
An... Anyways, please don't try to perform any stunts again.

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:56.220
Shit, there is no trace of her.

00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:57.620
What do we do?

00:15:58.290 --> 00:15:58.800
Everyone...

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:00.140
Class rep!

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:02.730
Thank goodness you are safe.

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:03.970
Don't scare us like that.

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:05.760
You sure know how to make other people worried.

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:08.010
I'm sorry that I've made you worry.

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:09.920
Well... I'm glad you are alright.

00:16:10.480 --> 00:16:12.210
I just found out something good.

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:18.180
I wanted to spend more time playing it.

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:20.150
Now I have to return it.

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:24.010
It was a mistake to let sis play games.

00:16:25.090 --> 00:16:25.560
Self-drawn.

00:16:25.090 --> 00:16:29.750
Note: To cut the explanation short, this is a really lousy way to lose in mahjong.

00:16:27.490 --> 00:16:29.750
Daisangen Suuankou Tanki.

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:33.450
That's impossible!

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:34.930
She's cheating!

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:37.060
This computer is cheating.

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:39.310
Sis sucks, that's all.

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:40.620
What did you say!?

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:42.390
Now, now. Calm down.

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:46.000
You couldn't win once even when the difficulty is set to "very easy".

00:16:47.010 --> 00:16:50.810
I guess sis is not compatible with games that need a little brain power.

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:51.650
Return it.

00:16:52.850 --> 00:16:53.960
Eh? What?

00:16:55.620 --> 00:16:58.460
Return this shitty game right now!

00:17:00.650 --> 00:17:02.720
Make sure to let a nice person play you next time.

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:06.470
I'm sorry to be abrupt.

00:17:06.780 --> 00:17:07.150
Huh?

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:08.870
You were the one who jumped onto the railway...

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:10.650
Fight with me right here.

00:17:10.950 --> 00:17:11.320
Huh?

00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:12.790
What? Me?

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:15.260
Now let's fight.

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:18.050
Oh shit!

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:20.270
You blocked my kick.

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:23.010
As I would expect from the man who Sanae-san has fallen for.

00:17:26.140 --> 00:17:27.630
The game is...

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:31.310
I spent a fortune on it because it was just released...

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:34.220
You bastard!

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:38.340
I don't know who you are or where you are from.

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:40.660
But don't think you can leave here alive!

00:17:41.180 --> 00:17:43.200
Oh? You are finally getting serious.

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:55.940
This guy is quick.

00:17:56.650 --> 00:17:59.050
What? You are out of breath already?

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:03.710
That's because I haven't ate anything nutritious recently...

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:06.840
If I had some of class rep's beef during lunch time...

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:08.820
It's my turn now.

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:10.240
Eat this!

00:18:17.940 --> 00:18:20.360
We are barely started.

00:18:21.310 --> 00:18:22.120
Shit...

00:18:26.610 --> 00:18:28.120
You are pretty good.

00:18:28.380 --> 00:18:29.600
Then have another one!

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:32.730
Shit...

00:18:33.070 --> 00:18:34.140
If it wasn't because of the hunger...

00:18:34.610 --> 00:18:36.920
Here comes the finishing blow!

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:41.760
Sis?

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:48.940
I was worried that you'll spend the money on something else.

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:51.190
Now it looks like you got yourself into something interesting.

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:53.110
What are you doing, little girl?

00:18:53.240 --> 00:18:54.350
Don't interfere with us.

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:57.040
This is a fight between men.

00:18:57.480 --> 00:18:58.350
Really?

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:00.870
I have no idea.

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:03.360
It looks like you are a martial artist.

00:19:03.670 --> 00:19:05.750
What do you want with us Miyamoto clan?

00:19:06.320 --> 00:19:07.600
Miyamoto clan?

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:10.090
Are you guys from the Miyamoto clan?

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:11.200
We indeed are.

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:14.810
Then he's not Inuzuka Koushi-dono?

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:18.590
What? Of course he's not Koushi onii-chan.

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:20.910
This guy is just a good-for-nothing.

00:19:21.100 --> 00:19:22.020
No way...

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:24.820
Sis, that's mean.

00:19:24.980 --> 00:19:26.970
Ah. I got the wrong person.

00:19:27.190 --> 00:19:28.750
I made a big mistake.

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:32.720
I thought Mr. Good-for-nothing is Inuzuka-san.

00:19:33.320 --> 00:19:37.360
So the other guy is Inuzuka-dono?

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:40.110
He doesn't look that strong though.

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:42.640
I guess you can't judge a book by its cover.

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:46.070
What do you want with onii-chan?

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:48.030
Could you be an assassin?

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:50.370
No, no.

00:19:50.390 --> 00:19:53.430
I'm from the eastern branch just like Inuzuka-dono.

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:55.010
I'm not an assassin.

00:19:55.200 --> 00:19:57.680
Then why are you after onii-chan?

00:19:58.000 --> 00:20:02.680
I just want to find out which one of us is stronger.

00:20:03.690 --> 00:20:06.120
You want to have a friendly match with someone stronger than you?

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:09.350
That's admirable as a martial artist.

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:13.870
Because of my rashness, I caused some trouble.

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:15.520
I'm really sorry.

00:20:18.930 --> 00:20:20.080
Is this okay, sis?

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:22.900
Letting a person who's after Koushi-kun go.

00:20:23.310 --> 00:20:25.540
Though he's after him, he's not an assassin.

00:20:26.420 --> 00:20:27.860
It's nothing to be worried about.

00:20:28.590 --> 00:20:30.700
Now, let's go return the game.

00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:32.570
What's wrong?

00:20:34.760 --> 00:20:37.750
It looks like we can't return it anymore.

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:41.460
You bastard...

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:44.470
It wasn't my fault!

00:20:44.710 --> 00:20:45.430
Shut up!

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:49.210
Eh?

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:51.670
We are having beef again?

00:20:51.970 --> 00:20:53.620
We still have a lot of it left.

00:20:53.820 --> 00:20:56.680
We'll be having beef for another two or three days.

00:20:56.850 --> 00:21:00.920
Speaking of which, I don't see the guys from the branch families, what happened to them?

00:21:01.390 --> 00:21:04.350
Oh yeah, there is a message from Hikaru-kun.

00:21:05.640 --> 00:21:09.730
He said he won't be seeing you until he becomes a man befitting you.

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:10.820
Really!?

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:12.480
Thank goodness.

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:15.580
I can return to my normal life for the time being.

00:21:19.190 --> 00:21:22.120
So this is where Inuzuka-dono trains.

00:21:24.860 --> 00:21:29.460
To prove that I'm a man befitting Sanae-san...

00:21:29.580 --> 00:21:34.440
The quickest way is to duel with Inuzuka-dono!

00:21:35.200 --> 00:21:37.370
Wait for me, Sanae-san!

